  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Budget Calculations**\n\nI\'m now focused on building `/src/utils/budgetCalculations.ts`. This involves designing the logic for prorated spending limits, generating daily budget breakdowns, cumulative spending curves, implementing rollover mechanics, and setting up automatic alert detection, all tailored to meet user requirements. I\'m carefully verifying the user\'s specific request to ensure alignment.\n\n\n**Defining Spending Limit Logic**\n\nI\'ve moved towards defining the logic for custom budget settings and daily spending tracking. My focus is on calculating prorated daily limits based on a monthly budget and the number of days in the month. I\'m generating a comprehensive daily breakdown that considers transactions, cumulative spending, and deviation from the prorated limit, which will be visualized as a line graph, to assist the user in tracking spending across a whole month. I\'m also ensuring the budget logic alerts users if they exceed this prorated limit.\n\n\n"
