    thinking: "**Constructing Dashboard View**\n\nI\'m now focusing on building the core dashboard view component. I plan to incorporate summary cards for key metrics like income, expenses, and cash flow. I also want to include a widget that highlights the status of prorated snack and custom items. Finally, a view of monthly burn rate is in the works.\n\n\n**Expanding Data Visualizations**\n\nI\'m now thinking about specific data visualizations. I want a line or bar chart for daily spend trends, and a donut or pie chart for category breakdowns, complete with percentages and a colored icon legend. Additionally, I\'m planning to include a list of recent transactions with quick actions and filter tags, and an active budget alerts banner to signal overages. I also have more ideas for `/src/components/views/TransactionsView.tsx`, `/src/components/views/MonthlyReportView.tsx` and `/src/components/views/BudgetsAndRecurringView.tsx`.\n\n\n"
