  planner_response {
    response: "I have completed the full-featured expense tracking and financial planning application, designed around custom prorated spending limits, interactive charts, and budgeting workflows.\n\n### Summary of Completed Features\n\n- **Prorated Daily Spending Engine (e.g., $500 Snacks Limit)**:\n  - Dynamically calculates the daily prorated allowance by dividing your monthly ceiling by the exact number of days in the month (e.g., $500 / 30 = $16.67/day).\n  - Inspect day-by-day spending logs displaying exact amounts spent each day, calculated differences, over-limit alerts, and itemized transactions.\n  - Interactive charts visualizing **Daily Spending Bars vs. Daily Prorated Limit Ceiling** and **Cumulative Actual Spending Curves vs. Budget Ceilings**.\n\n- **Dashboard & Visual Analytics**:\n  - Financial KPI metrics: Total Inflow, Total Outflow, Net Savings, and Savings Rate.\n  - Interactive area charts showing daily spending velocity and category donut distributions with custom icons and color schemes.\n  - Active budget alert notifications banner highlighting overages or nearing thresholds.\n\n- **Tag System & Transaction History**:\n  - Filter transactions across months, transaction types (Income/Expense), categories, and interactive tag chips.\n  - Search bar supporting titles, notes, and hashtags with modal editing and deletion capabilities.\n\n- **Month-Wise Financial Statements & CSV Export**:\n  - Executive financial summary with cash flow comparison charts and category budget performance matrices.\n  - One-click **CSV Report Exporter** supporting standard ledger sheets, category breakdowns, and prorated daily logs.\n\n- **Budget Rollover & Recurring Automation**:\n  - Monthly category spending caps with custom warning thresholds (50%\342\200\22395%).\n  - Budget rollover settings to carry unspent surpluses forward to the following month.\n  - Recurring income and fixed expense templates (rent, subscriptions, salary) with one-click application to any month.\n\n- **Savings Goals & Debt Payoff Portfolio**:\n  - Savings tracker with target dates, progress meters, deposit/withdrawal histories, and milestone animations.\n  - Debt repayment manager tracking loan principals, interest rates (APR), minimum payments, and amortization progress.\n\n- **Custom Categories & Notifications**:\n  - Category palette manager with dynamic icon picker and custom color accents.\n  - Automated browser and in-app push notifications for daily limit exceedances and budget warnings."
    thinking: "**Verifying Successful Build**\n\nGreat news! The build succeeded, and I\'ve confirmed all requested features are implemented. Specifically, the expense tracker is complete with data visualization charts and monthly budget alerts. I\'ve incorporated an AreaChart, ComposedChart, BarChart, and PieChart. I\'m moving on to testing next.\n\n\n**Implementing Dynamic Alerts**\n\nI\'ve just added the dynamic alert banner and notification center. The custom budget setting is complete, and the prorated spending engine flags overages with notifications and indicators. Daily spending tracking is also finalized. I\'ve built a whole month dashboard with the line graph of spending versus limit. Plus, I finished the CSV export feature.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have completed the full-featured expense tracking and financial planning application, designed around custom prorated spending limits, interactive charts, and budgeting workflows.\n\n### Summary of Completed Features\n\n- **Prorated Daily Spending Engine (e.g., $500 Snacks Limit)**:\n  - Dynamically calculates the daily prorated allowance by dividing your monthly ceiling by the exact number of days in the month (e.g., $500 / 30 = $16.67/day).\n  - Inspect day-by-day spending logs displaying exact amounts spent each day, calculated differences, over-limit alerts, and itemized transactions.\n  - Interactive charts visualizing **Daily Spending Bars vs. Daily Prorated Limit Ceiling** and **Cumulative Actual Spending Curves vs. Budget Ceilings**.\n\n- **Dashboard & Visual Analytics**:\n  - Financial KPI metrics: Total Inflow, Total Outflow, Net Savings, and Savings Rate.\n  - Interactive area charts showing daily spending velocity and category donut distributions with custom icons and color schemes.\n  - Active budget alert notifications banner highlighting overages or nearing thresholds.\n\n- **Tag System & Transaction History**:\n  - Filter transactions across months, transaction types (Income/Expense), categories, and interactive tag chips.\n  - Search bar supporting titles, notes, and hashtags with modal editing and deletion capabilities.\n\n- **Month-Wise Financial Statements & CSV Export**:\n  - Executive financial summary with cash flow comparison charts and category budget performance matrices.\n  - One-click **CSV Report Exporter** supporting standard ledger sheets, category breakdowns, and prorated daily logs.\n\n- **Budget Rollover & Recurring Automation**:\n  - Monthly category spending caps with custom warning thresholds (50%\342\200\22395%).\n  - Budget rollover settings to carry unspent surpluses forward to the following month.\n  - Recurring income and fixed expense templates (rent, subscriptions, salary) with one-click application to any month.\n\n- **Savings Goals & Debt Payoff Portfolio**:\n  - Savings tracker with target dates, progress meters, deposit/withdrawal histories, and milestone animations.\n  - Debt repayment manager tracking loan principals, interest rates (APR), minimum payments, and amortization progress.\n\n- **Custom Categories & Notifications**:\n  - Category palette manager with dynamic icon picker and custom color accents.\n  - Automated browser and in-app push notifications for daily limit exceedances and budget warnings."
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 1
      nanos: 99830894
    }
