  user_input {
    user_response: "Apply the \"Immersive UI\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Immersive UI\nDesign HTML: <!doctype html>\\n<html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n    <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n    <style>\\n      body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n      /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n      .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n      .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n      .flex { display: flex; }\\n      .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n      .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n    </style>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <style>:root{--bg:#09090b;--card:#111114;--accent:#c1ff72;--muted:#71717a;--danger:#ff5f5f;--border:rgba(255,255,255,0.06)}body{background-color:var(--bg);color:#fff;font-family:\'Inter\',system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;margin:0;height:768px;width:1024px;overflow:hidden}.glow-bg{position:absolute;top:-10%;left:-10%;width:40%;height:40%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(193,255,114,0.05) 0%,transparent 70%);pointer-events:none}.glass-card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);border-radius:16px}.stat-value{font-size:24px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.5px}.tag{font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);border:1px solid var(--border)}</style><div class=\'relative h-full w-full p-6 flex flex-col gap-6\'><div class=\'glow-bg\'></div><header class=\'flex justify-between items-end mb-2\'><div class=\'flex flex-col\'> <h1 class=\'text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight\'>FINANCE<span class=\'text-[#c1ff72]\'>FLOW</span></h1><p class=\'text-xs text-muted mt-1 uppercase tracking-widest\'>Atmospheric Expense Monitoring \342\200\242 October 2023</p></div><div class=\'flex gap-3\'><button class=\'glass-card px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors\'>EXPORT CSV</button><button class=\'bg-[#c1ff72] text-black px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold rounded-lg shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(193,255,114,0.3)]\'>ADD TRANSACTION</button></div></header><div class=\'grid grid-cols-12 gap-6 flex-1 overflow-hidden\'><aside class=\'col-span-3 flex flex-col gap-6\'><div class=\'glass-card p-5 flex flex-col gap-4\'> <h3 class=\'text-xs font-bold text-muted uppercase\'>Categories</h3><div class=\'flex flex-col gap-3\'><div class=\'flex justify-between items-center\'><span class=\'text-sm\'>\360\237\215\277 Snacks</span><span class=\'text-sm font-mono\'>$242.50</span></div><div class=\'flex justify-between items-center\'><span class=\'text-sm text-muted\'>\360\237\217\240 Rent</span><span class=\'text-sm font-mono\'>$1,800.00</span></div><div class=\'flex justify-between items-center\'><span class=\'text-sm text-muted\'>\360\237\232\227 Transport</span><span class=\'text-sm font-mono\'>$120.30</span></div><div class=\'flex justify-between items-center\'><span class=\'text-sm text-muted\'>\360\237\223\261 Subscriptions</span><span class=\'text-sm font-mono\'>$45.99</span></div></div></div><div class=\'glass-card p-5 flex-1\'> <h3 class=\'text-xs font-bold text-muted uppercase mb-4\'>Recurring Items</h3><div class=\'space-y-4\'><div class=\'flex flex-col gap-1\'><div class=\'flex justify-between text-xs\'><span class=\'text-white\'>Spotify Duo</span><span class=\'text-[#c1ff72]\'>Auto</span></div><div class=\'w-full h-1 bg-white/5 rounded-full overflow-hidden\'><div class=\'h-full bg-[#c1ff72] w-[60%]\'></div></div></div><div class=\'flex flex-col gap-1\'><div class=\'flex justify-between text-xs\'><span class=\'text-white\'>Rent (Central)</span><span class=\'text-[#c1ff72]\'>Auto</span></div><div class=\'w-full h-1 bg-white/5 rounded-full overflow-hidden\'><div class=\'h-full bg-[#c1ff72] w-[100%]\'></div></div></div></div> <h3 class=\'text-xs font-bold text-muted uppercase mt-8 mb-4\'>Quick Tags</h3><div class=\'flex flex-wrap gap-2\'><span class=\'tag\'>Essential</span><span class=\'tag\'>Impulse</span><span class=\'tag\'>Work</span><span class=\'tag\'>Tax-Deduct</span></div></div></aside><main class=\'col-span-6 flex flex-col gap-6\'><div class=\'glass-card p-6 flex-1 relative flex flex-col\'> <h3 class=\'text-xs font-bold text-muted uppercase mb-6\'>Expense Trajectory \342\200\242 Actual vs Daily Limit</h3><div class=\'flex-1 relative mb-4\'><svg viewBox=\'0 0 500 150\' class=\'w-full h-full\' preserveAspectRatio=\'none\'><path d=\'M0,150 L500,50\' stroke=\'rgba(255,255,255,0.1)\' stroke-dasharray=\'4\' fill=\'none\'/><path d=\'M0,140 L50,135 L100,130 L150,110 L200,105 L250,95 L300,90 L350,55 L400,60 L450,40\' stroke=\'var(--accent)\' stroke-width=\'2.5\' fill=\'none\' class=\'drop-shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(193,255,114,0.4)]\'/></svg><div class=\'absolute top-0 left-0 text-[10px] text-muted flex flex-col gap-10\'><span>$2k</span><span>$1k</span><span>$0</span></div></div><div class=\'flex justify-around border-t border-white/5 pt-4\'><div class=\'text-center\'><p class=\'text-xs text-muted uppercase\'>Daily Spend</p><p class=\'stat-value\'>$16.66</p></div><div class=\'text-center\'><p class=\'text-xs text-muted uppercase\'>Total Assets</p><p class=\'stat-value\'>$12,450</p></div><div class=\'text-center\'><p class=\'text-xs text-muted uppercase\'>Debt Balance</p><p class=\'stat-value text-danger\'>$2,100</p></div></div></div><div class=\'glass-card p-6 h-48 flex items-center gap-8\'><div class=\'relative w-32 h-32 flex items-center justify-center\'><svg viewBox=\'0 0 36 36\' class=\'w-full h-full transform -rotate-90\'><circle cx=\'18\' cy=\'18\' r=\'16\' fill=\'none\' stroke=\'rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\' stroke-width=\'3\'/><circle cx=\'18\' cy=\'18\' r=\'16\' fill=\'none\' stroke=\'var(--accent)\' stroke-width=\'3\' stroke-dasharray=\'48, 100\' stroke-linecap=\'round\' class=\'drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_var(--accent)]\'/></svg><div class=\'absolute flex flex-col items-center\'><span class=\'text-xs font-bold text-muted\'>SNACKS</span><span class=\'text-lg font-bold\'>48%</span></div></div><div class=\'flex-1 flex flex-col gap-2\'><h4 class=\'text-sm font-semibold\'>Daily Snack Limit (Prorated)</h4><p class=\'text-xs text-muted\'>Current day: 15 / 31</p><div class=\'flex items-baseline gap-2 mt-1\'><span class=\'text-2xl font-mono text-[#c1ff72]\'>$16.12</span><span class=\'text-xs text-muted\'>/ $16.66 daily target</span></div><p class=\'text-[11px] text-danger mt-2 uppercase font-bold tracking-tighter bg-danger/10 px-2 py-1 rounded inline-block\'>Alert: Impulse purchase trend detected</p></div></div></main><section class=\'col-span-3 flex flex-col gap-6\'><div class=\'glass-card p-5 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#c1ff72]/10 to-transparent\'><h3 class=\'text-xs font-bold text-[#c1ff72] uppercase mb-4\'>Budget Alerts</h3><div class=\'space-y-3\'><div class=\'p-3 rounded-lg bg-white/5 border-l-2 border-danger\'><p class=\'text-[11px] font-bold text-danger mb-1\'>DAILY LIMIT EXCEEDED</p><p class=\'text-xs leading-relaxed\'>Snack spend hit $22.40 on Oct 14. Daily limit was $16.66.</p></div><div class=\'p-3 rounded-lg bg-white/5 border-l-2 border-[#c1ff72]\'><p class=\'text-[11px] font-bold text-[#c1ff72] mb-1\'>ROLLOVER APPLIED</p><p class=\'text-xs leading-relaxed\'>+$42.00 from Travel category added to Savings.</p></div></div></div><div class=\'glass-card p-5 flex-1 flex flex-col\'> <h3 class=\'text-xs font-bold text-muted uppercase mb-4\'>Savings & Goals</h3><div class=\'space-y-4 flex-1\'><div class=\'flex flex-col gap-2\'><div class=\'flex justify-between items-end\'><span class=\'text-sm\'>New Laptop</span><span class=\'text-xs font-mono text-muted\'>$1.8k / $2.5k</span></div><div class=\'w-full h-1.5 bg-white/5 rounded-full\'><div class=\'h-full bg-white w-[72%]\'></div></div></div><div class=\'flex flex-col gap-2\'><div class=\'flex justify-between items-end\'><span class=\'text-sm\'>Emergency Fund</span><span class=\'text-xs font-mono text-muted\'>$5.0k / $10k</span></div><div class=\'w-full h-1.5 bg-white/5 rounded-full\'><div class=\'h-full bg-white w-[50%]\'></div></div></div></div><div class=\'mt-auto p-4 bg-white/5 rounded-xl text-center\'><p class=\'text-[10px] text-muted uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\'>Projected Savings</p><p class=\'text-xl font-bold\'>$412.50 <span class=\'text-xs text-[#c1ff72] font-normal\'>+12%</span></p></div></div></section></div></div>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic. You MUST execute file editing or creation tool calls (such as edit_file, multi_edit_file, or create_file) to apply styling updates to target files directly. Do NOT output code blocks, HTML, or TSX directly in your text chat response.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Immersive UI\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Immersive UI\nDesign HTML: <!doctype html>\\n<html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n    <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n    <style>\\n      body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n      /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n      .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n      .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n      .flex { display: flex; }\\n      .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n      .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n    </style>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <style>:root{--bg:#09090b;--card:#111114;--accent:#c1ff72;--muted:#71717a;--danger:#ff5f5f;--border:rgba(255,255,255,0.06)}body{background-color:var(--bg);color:#fff;font-family:\'Inter\',system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;margin:0;height:768px;width:1024px;overflow:hidden}.glow-bg{position:absolute;top:-10%;left:-10%;width:40%;height:40%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(193,255,114,0.05) 0%,transparent 70%);pointer-events:none}.glass-card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);border-radius:16px}.stat-value{font-size:24px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.5px}.tag{font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);border:1px solid var(--border)}</style><div class=\'relative h-full w-full p-6 flex flex-col gap-6\'><div class=\'glow-bg\'></div><header class=\'flex justify-between items-end mb-2\'><div class=\'flex flex-col\'> <h1 class=\'text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight\'>FINAN