  planner_response {
    response: "I have created a comprehensive `docs/` documentation suite and a root `README.md` file for the application:\n\n### \360\237\223\232 Documentation Suite Overview\n\n- \360\237\223\230 **`README.md`** (Root):\n  - Project summary and core highlights (Prorated daily pacing, \342\202\271 INR default, SQLite database, debt payoff, recurring items, CSV import/export).\n  - High-level architecture ASCII diagram and file tree breakdown.\n  - Quickstart guides for installation, development mode, and production bundling.\n  - Direct links to in-depth technical documentation in `docs/`.\n\n- \360\237\217\233\357\270\217 **`docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`**:\n  - Full-stack technical architecture (React 18 SPA + Tailwind CSS + Global `ExpenseContext` + Express.js + SQLite WebAssembly engine).\n  - Module decomposition and directory tree breakdown.\n  - State lifecycle, atomic write-through disk persistence mechanics, and visual design standards.\n\n- \360\237\222\241 **`docs/FEATURES.md`**:\n  - Deep-dive feature catalog covering all 7 core views: **Dashboard**, **Prorated Limits**, **Transactions Ledger**, **Budgets & Recurring**, **Savings & Debt**, **Monthly Reports**, and **Category Settings**.\n  - Detailed breakdown of modal tools including the **SQLite Manager** and **CSV Importer/Exporter**.\n\n- \360\237\223\220 **`docs/PRORATED_BUDGETING_GUIDE.md`**:\n  - Detailed mathematical formulation of the Prorated Daily Budget Engine.\n  - Formulas for Daily Spending Limit $L_d = (B_m + S_r) / D_m$, Linear Expected Spend $E_k$, Pacing Variance $\\Delta_k$, and Dynamic Safe Daily Ceiling $L_{\\text{rem}}$.\n  - Rollover surplus rules and proactive alert threshold mechanics.\n\n- \360\237\224\214 **`docs/API_REFERENCE.md`**:\n  - Complete RESTful JSON API specifications for all `/api/*` endpoints (Transactions, Categories, Prorated Rules, Savings, Debts, Recurring Bills, User Settings, and SQLite Database status/reset).\n  - Sample request bodies, parameters, and JSON response schemas.\n\n- \360\237\227\203\357\270\217 **`docs/DATABASE_SCHEMA.md`**:\n  - Entity Relationship Diagram (ERD) with relational mappings.\n  - Full SQL DDL table creation scripts (`transactions`, `categories`, `prorated_rules`, `savings_goals`, `savings_history`, `debts`, `debt_payments`, `recurring_items`, `user_settings`, `read_alerts`).\n  - Index definitions and data persistence workflows."
